msgstr ""
"In addition to the actions usually available in the “Hamburger” menu, "
"from the file explorer, you have these two additional actions:"

#: ../../docs-gofast-users/doc-gofast-guide-utilisateurs_2.rst:798
#: 5aafa1d08bb84f6196d84205e9bdcec7
