"modèle de processus ayant des documents déjà présélectionnés)."
msgstr ""
"When starting a process from the quick action bar (main menu at the top),"
" the process form does not include a document, so it must be added "
"directly from that form (unless the process is started on documents in "
"your cart or a process model with already pre-selected documents)."

#: ../../docs-gofast-users/doc-gofast-guide-utilisateurs_3.rst:579
#: f5ad28f36f2f4a49b4293944ec43ca75
msgid ""
"En lançant un processus depuis le menu principal sur les documents du "
