"processus. Vous avez ensuite la possibilité d'enlever/ajouter les "
"documents dans le formulaire du workflow."
msgstr ""
"By launching a process from the main menu on the documents in the "
"\"cart\", the latter are automatically associated with the process. You "
"then have the option to remove/add documents in the workflow form."

#: ../../docs-gofast-users/doc-gofast-guide-utilisateurs_3.rst:582
