msgstr ""
"You can select a model (to have the pre-filled process form) via the "
"drop-down list available for each process type. In this case, select the "
"desired model before clicking \">\"."

#: ../../docs-gofast-users/doc-gofast-guide-utilisateurs_3.rst:607
#: e77c739f202d4599b4acee735a41789c
msgid "Merci de vous référer également à la rubrique : « Panier Documentaire »."
msgstr "Please also refer to the section: “Cart”."

#: ../../docs-gofast-users/doc-gofast-guide-utilisateurs_3.rst:611
#: 9ac78c68e3fc4fb2b1dd41673d8524bd
msgid "Renseigner le formulaire du processus de tâches"
