msgstr ""
"Once the desired process is selected, the associated form opens and "
"allows you to fill in the various necessary information. The proposed "
"form and therefore the fields to be filled in are totally dependent on "
"the chosen process."

#: ../../docs-gofast-users/doc-gofast-guide-utilisateurs_3.rst:619
#: 672369788bad4574942ef964e5e77cdf
msgid ""
"**Focus sur les champs \"Document(s)\" et \"Assignation(s)\" du "
"formulaire :** Dans le cas du processus standard, parmi les champs "
"proposés il y a les documents associés et les personnes à assigner."
msgstr ""
"**Focus on the \"Document(s)\" and \"Assignment(s)\" fields of the "
"form:** In the case of the standard process, among the proposed fields "
"there are associated documents and the persons to be assigned."

#: ../../docs-gofast-users/doc-gofast-guide-utilisateurs_3.rst:622
#: 4f55420f5e464b18acaf8c7200036822
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Pour correctement renseigner ces champs, il est nécessaire de commencer à"
" saisir le nom du document, d’un utilisateur (minimum 3 caractères),ou "
"encore le nom d'une liste d'utilisateur, puis de cliquer sur la "
"suggestion pour valider son choix."
msgstr ""
"To correctly fill in these fields, you must start entering the name of "
"the document or of a user (minimum 3 characters), then click on the "
"suggestion to validate your choice."

#: ../../docs-gofast-users/doc-gofast-guide-utilisateurs_3.rst:624
#: 64973c05daf04f95b18fd21c74b476b0
#, fuzzy
